{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/deviceLogin(scope:tenantID:configuration:onAuthorization:)"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The composed helper (§14.3): authorize, hand the caller the codes, poll to completion."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/devicelogin(scope:tenantid:configuration:onauthorization:)"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"deviceLogin"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"scope"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"tenantID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"configuration"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/OidcConfiguration","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK17OidcConfigurationV","text":"OidcConfiguration"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"onAuthorization"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@Sendable"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/DeviceAuthorization","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK19DeviceAuthorizationV","text":"DeviceAuthorization"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/OidcTokenSet","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK12OidcTokenSetV","text":"OidcTokenSet"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onAuthorization"},{"type":"text","text":" is called "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"before polling begins"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and is the only place the user code"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and verification URI are surfaced. §14.3 rule 2 is explicit that an SDK must not print"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them to stdout on the caller’s behalf — a device shows them however it can: a screen, a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"QR code, an e-ink panel."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The returned token set is "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not adopted"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" as this client’s credential. Adoption is the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same MAY as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"loginClientCredentials"},{"type":"text","text":" (§14.3 rule 4), and this SDK takes one posture"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"everywhere: return the tokens, install nothing."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Polling follows §14.2 exactly: the interval starts at the server’s, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"slow_down"},{"type":"text","text":" adds 5 s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"permanently, and the loop stops at "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"expires_in"},{"type":"text","text":" even if the server has not yet said so."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"429 rate_limit_exceeded"},{"type":"text","text":" (contract 1.64, rule 9) is not terminal and is not a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"slow_down"},{"type":"text","text":": the next wait is the longer of the interval and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Retry-After"},{"type":"text","text":", it stands in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for that one interval, the interval itself is unchanged, and when the wait would pass the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deadline the loop raises "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"expired_token"},{"type":"text","text":" at once and sends nothing after it."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"deviceLogin(scope:tenantID:configuration:onAuthorization:)","role":"symbol","extendedModule":"AxiamSDK","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deviceLogin","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"scope"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"tenantID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"configuration"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK17OidcConfigurationV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"OidcConfiguration"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"onAuthorization"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK19DeviceAuthorizationV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"DeviceAuthorization"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Void"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword",